message: "If you use this software or its data, cite it as below."
title: "2x Single-Stock ETF Ledger"
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ossilon/2x-ledger"
url: "https://github.com/ossilon/2x-ledger"
authors:
  - name: "ossilon"
abstract: >-
  A monthly research ledger on US-listed 2x long single-stock ETFs. The engine measures each fund against
  its stock on total return, splits the result into compounding, financing, rebalancing and product cost,
  and publishes one CSV row per fund per month with the method, tests and pre-registered hypotheses.
keywords:
  - leveraged ETF
  - single-stock ETF
  - daily reset
  - volatility drag
  - financing cost
